            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Kill Shock" id="11ba8b96-ef14-7ab6-e517-d00859ffe02b" hidden="false" page="104" publicationId="635e04e0--pubN66402">
              <description>By concentrating the beam of energy,  the storm vortex&apos;s power is greatly enhanced so that when it strikes a vehicle, it takes D3 Haywire rolls. Against targets with Toughness, wounds inflict Instant Death on a To Wound 5+ roll (regardless of target&apos;s Toughness).</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
