    <profile name="Soul-trap" id="fe070721-5474-2fce-a502-b1910842e3b7" hidden="false" page="0" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">A model with a soul-trap receives a +1 Strength (up to a maximum of 10) for the rest of the battle for each unsaved Wound it inflicts in a challenge on an enemy character.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Spirit Probe" id="792f0e77-00c1-738b-a3d7-ecf32bde3b3b" hidden="false" page="0" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">The model, and all friendly units with both the Dark Eldar Faction and the Feel No Pain special rule within 6&quot; of one of more models with a spirit probe, receive a + 1 bonus to their Feel No Pain. This is cumulative with any other modifiers to Feel No Pain, but cannot improve their Feel No Pain beyond 4+.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
