    <selectionEntry name="Formation: The Murderflock" id="2574-7ebb-5993-95c6" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" page="52" publicationId="635e04e0--pubN93789" type="unit">
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
      </costs>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Restrictions (The Murderflock)" id="fdee-4244-abc4-2d93" hidden="false" page="52" publicationId="635e04e0--pubN93789">
          <description>- All Hellion units must consist of at least 15 models.
- All Scourge units must consist of 10 models.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Vicious Descent (The Murderflock)" id="fe63-21a2-0782-3fdd" hidden="false" page="52" publicationId="635e04e0--pubN93789">
          <description>All units in a Murderflock begin the game in Strategic Reserve. When they become available, you may delpoy a single unit from the formation by Deep Strike without scattering. All other units in the formation must then deploy by Deep Strike without scattering, and within 6&quot; of a model from the first unit deployed.

Once this is done, enemy units within 3&quot; of any model from this formation suffer 2D6 Strength 4 AP5 hits with the Redning special rule (vehicles are hit on thier side armour). Keep track of unsaved wounds caused. Once this process is complete, every unit in the formation gains a pain token for every five unsaved Wounds (or part thereof) caused. For instance, if a Murderflock causes 11 unsaved Wounds with its Vicious Descent, all of the units in the Murderflock gain three pain tokens.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Hellions" id="bd70-ceb3-9482-b5b1" collective="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="3048-4525-7770-6a88" hidden="false" import="true">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="90e8-be92-ce5b-f6c6" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="false" type="min" value="2"/>
          </constraints>
          <entryLinks>
            <entryLink name="Hellions" id="3048-4525-7770-6a88" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" targetId="77c4799f-3512-6940-bf28-fcc41fd40996" type="selectionEntry"/>
          </entryLinks>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Scourges" id="969f-358d-c0ac-e4d6" collective="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="930e-94e3-d91c-27cc" hidden="false" import="true">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="2a65-4a9b-05ef-141f" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="false" type="min" value="2"/>
          </constraints>
          <entryLinks>
            <entryLink name="Scourges" id="930e-94e3-d91c-27cc" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" targetId="587464b9-230d-ceca-7b26-46d74cfb3cd5" type="selectionEntry"/>
          </entryLinks>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
      </selectionEntryGroups>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry name="Formation: Storm of Blades" id="65a2-bc9f-67ca-0a7f" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" page="53" publicationId="635e04e0--pubN93789" type="unit">
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
      </costs>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Restrictions (Storm of Blades)" id="66d9-6508-d74e-fe0d" hidden="false" page="53" publicationId="635e04e0--pubN93789">
          <description>- All Archons, Kabalite Warriors, and Kabalite Trueborn units in the formation must begin the game embarked upon Dedicated Transports.
- All Raiders in the formation must have the enhanced aethersails upgrade.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Skybound (Storm of Blades)" id="c025-4148-6807-b30d" hidden="false" page="53" publicationId="635e04e0--pubN93789">
          <description>Units from this battle formation may not voluntarily disembark or Go to Ground. Any unit that disembarks, for any reason, immediately loses a pain token. If it has no pain tokens, it instead takes a Pinning test. At the beginning of each Dark Eldar Shooting phase, a unit from this formation may choose to have the Skyfire special rule for the duration of that phase.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Storm of Blades (Storm of Blades)" id="3469-8b9a-15b1-29ed" hidden="false" page="53" publicationId="635e04e0--pubN93789">
          <description>Raiders from this formation, and units embarked on them, may shoot in the same turn they use the bonus move from their enhanced aethersails. They may then move Flat Out as if they had not shot that turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Storm Of Blades - At Least 3 Units Required" id="bde6-db3c-634f-76dd" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" page="53" publicationId="635e04e0--pubN93789">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="728d-a943-feff-855c" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="3"/>
          </constraints>
          <entryLinks>
            <entryLink name="Reavers" id="5de0-4368-a886-c3af" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" targetId="5f906016-1d30-7424-444b-c347f752e913" type="selectionEntry"/>
            <entryLink name="Scourges" id="4736-bfa2-f73c-65c1" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" targetId="587464b9-230d-ceca-7b26-46d74cfb3cd5" type="selectionEntry"/>
            <entryLink name="Hellions" id="4ce3-13ef-fae9-9c0c" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" targetId="77c4799f-3512-6940-bf28-fcc41fd40996" type="selectionEntry"/>
